---
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
const palette = siteConfig.palette;
---

<div class="card">
    <div class="proj-id">
        FLGSHP_PRJ_NANOMAKER.....ONLINE<span class="cursor">●</span>
    </div>
    <span class="blink1">+-</span>
    <span class="blink2">--</span>
    <span class="blink3">--</span>
    <span class="blink4">--</span>
    <span class="blink5">--</span>
    <span class="blink6">-+</span>
    <div class="proj-name">NanoMaker</div>
    <span class="blink6">+-</span>
    <span class="blink5">--</span>
    <span class="blink4">--</span>
    <span class="blink3">--</span>
    <span class="blink2">--</span>
    <span class="blink1">-+</span>

    <p class="proj-desc">* inverse radial sequencing-based protein design *</p>
    <p class="body-paragraph">
        <br />
        A dual cross-attention transformer system for high-affinity protein binding
        pocket design around any given chemical compound's scaffold.
        <br />
        <br />
        NanoMaker applies transformer logic towards the 3D biochemical protein space.
        Through Inverse Radial Sequencing, NanoMaker translates 3D protein structures
        into clear, sequentially-organized spatial data. This turns the challenge
        of de novo (from scratch) protein pocket design into a sequential vector generation
        task.
        <br />
        <br />
        Binding pocket design is elegantly performed by two cross-attention transformer
        models conditioned on drug scaffold molecular fingerprints:
        <br />
        ** Skeleton: generates the 3D spatial arrangement of blank alpha-carbon coordinates,
        the "skeleton"
        <br />
        ** NAAnoBot: sequentially populates each slot by curating specific biochemical
        environment features and aligning them + selecting an amino acid based on
        its hand-curated feature vector
        <br />
        <br />
        Trained on 7M sequence windows from high-affinity protein-drug complexes (BindingDB
        + PDB, ≤0.1nM ), with a zero-shot train/test split across drug scaffolds.
    </p>
    <br />
    <a
        href={"https://github.com/Elliot-Chan-120/NanoMaker/blob/main/README.md"}
        target="_blank"
        class="btn"
    >
        ACCESS: DOCUMENTATION/TESTRUN/MODEL_BEHAVIOUR <span class="arrow"
            >→</span
        >
    </a>
    <br />

    <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">De Novo Protein Design</span>
        <span class="tag">Feature Engineering</span>
        <span class="tag">Transformer</span>
        <span class="tag">Cross-Attention</span>
        <span class="tag">PyTorch</span>
        <span class="tag">Domain Integration</span>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .card {
        --text-primary: #d8dee9;
        --text-secondary: #d8dee9;
        --accent: #4c566a;
        border: 1px solid var(--accent);
        padding: 1rem;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    }
    .proj-id {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .proj-name {
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #a7b5cd;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .proj-desc {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .body-paragraph {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }
    .val {
        font-size: 10px;
        color: #a3be8c;
        margin-left: 8px;
    }
    .bar {
        height: 3px;
        background: #5e81ac;
        margin-top: 3px;
    }
    .fill {
        height: 3px;
        background: #a3be8c;
    }
    .tags {
        display: flex;
        gap: 6px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .tag {
        font-size: 9px;
        padding: 2px 7px;
        border: 1px solid #1e3a2f;
        color: #4a8c6a;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .btn {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: left;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-decoration: none;

        background: transparent;
        color:;
        border: 1px solid #a7b5cd;
        margin-top: 8px;

        transition:
            background 0.15s,
            color 0.15s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
        background: #a7b5cd;
        color: #0d0f12; /* or var(--bg) if you set that variable */
    }

    .arrow {
        transition: transform 0.15s;
    }

    .btn:hover .arrow {
        transform: translateX(3px);
    }

    .cursor {
        color: #a7b5cd;
        animation: blink 1.1s step-end infinite;
        margin-left: 2px;
    }

    .blink1 {
        color: #2e3440;
        animation: blink 1.5s step-end infinite;
        animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }
    .blink2 {
        color: #3b4252;
        animation: blink 1.5s step-end infinite;
        animation-delay: 0.4s;
    }
    .blink3 {
        color: #434c5e;
        animation: blink 1.5s step-end infinite;
        animation-delay: 0.6s;
    }
    .blink4 {
        color: #4c566a;
        animation: blink 1.5s step-end infinite;
        animation-delay: 0.8s;
    }
    .blink5 {
        color: #d8dee9;
        animation: blink 1.5s step-end infinite;
        animation-delay: 1s;
    }
    .blink6 {
        color: #a7b5cd;
        animation: blink 1.5s step-end infinite;
        animation-delay: 1.2s;
    }

</style>
